Package: tarball-manager
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, polkit
Maintainer: ryovoid
Description: Install Linux app tarballs as desktop applications
 Tarball Manager lets you install, manage, and update
 applications distributed as .tar.gz/.tar.xz archives.
 It detects executables, creates desktop entries, and
 handles both user and system-wide installations.
